    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46419" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴδι-ον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			, <i>small figure, painted</i> or <i>carved</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.374.288
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11(2).161
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				74
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.673f
			</span></i>; <i>statuette</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				717.6
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>); of large figures, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. πηχῶν ἑκκαίδεκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astron.,
				<i>sign of the Zodiac</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ μέσων τῶν ζ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1073b20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κύκλος ὁ τῶν ζ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					343a24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.15
			</span></i>. 
			<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hipparch.
				2.1.3
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Autol.
				1.10
			</span></i>, etc.:— also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωΐδιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				544
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				1.309
			</span></i>, al.</div>
